Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:33:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] bullhead: add RGB LED HAL service

vendor.lineage.rgbled@1.0-service.bullhead implements IRgbLed on top of
/sys/class/leds/{red,green,blue}. Register it in the device manifest and
add it to PRODUCT_PACKAGES.
---
 device.mk                                     |   4 +
 manifest.xml                                  |   9 +
 rgbled/Android.mk                             |  38 ++++
 rgbled/RgbLed.cpp                             | 187 ++++++++++++++++++
 rgbled/RgbLed.h                               |  62 ++++++
 rgbled/service.cpp                            |  44 +++++
 ...dor.lineage.rgbled@1.0-service.bullhead.rc |   9 +
 7 files changed, 353 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 rgbled/Android.mk
 create mode 100644 rgbled/RgbLed.cpp
 create mode 100644 rgbled/RgbLed.h
 create mode 100644 rgbled/service.cpp
 create mode 100644 rgbled/vendor.lineage.rgbled@1.0-service.bullhead.rc

